      "message": "No problem! Rust libraries don\u0027t need to provide headers when used to compile/link against other Rust code. However, the Rust library sharedlib/staticlib variants, which are used by CC modules, can define include paths to headers for CC modules to use. This is what I\u0027m capturing at lines 712-735 in rust/library.go in collectHeadersForSnapshot.",
